{%- comment -%}
An Atom feed of the works, newest first, at the path the theme's footer and
head link to. jekyll-feed does not write its empty posts feed when this file
is in the source root, so it stays here rather than in _pages/.
Every string from the data file is escaped. The data file dates a work by its
year only, so a work's `updated` is the first day of that year, and the
feed's is that of the newest work, or 1970 when no work has a year; the feed
is the same on every build. A work with no year has no date to give, so it is
left out of the feed.

Unescaped outputs. Every output not listed here is escaped.
- `'/feed.xml' | absolute_url`: the site path is a literal in this template; absolute_url only prefixes the url and baseurl from _config.yml.
- `'/' | absolute_url`: the site path is a literal in this template; absolute_url only prefixes the url and baseurl from _config.yml.
- `'/publications/' | absolute_url`: the site path is a literal in this template; absolute_url only prefixes the url and baseurl from _config.yml.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pubs = site.data.lab.works | where_exp: "w", "w.year != nil" -%}
{%- assign years = pubs | map: "year" | uniq | sort | reverse -%}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom">
<title>{{ site.title | xml_escape }} works</title>
<link href="{{ '/feed.xml' | absolute_url }}" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/>
<link href="{{ '/' | absolute_url }}" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
<id>{{ '/feed.xml' | absolute_url }}</id>
<updated>{{ years.first | default: 1970 | xml_escape }}-01-01T00:00:00Z</updated>
{%- for year in years %}{% assign year_pubs = pubs | where: "year", year %}{% for w in year_pubs %}
<entry>
<title type="text">{{ w.title | xml_escape }}</title>
<link href="{{ '/publications/' | absolute_url }}{{ w.bib_id | xml_escape }}/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
<id>{{ '/publications/' | absolute_url }}{{ w.bib_id | xml_escape }}/</id>
<updated>{{ w.year | xml_escape }}-01-01T00:00:00Z</updated>
{%- for a in w.authors %}
<author><name>{{ a.name | xml_escape }}</name></author>
{%- endfor %}
<summary type="text">{% if w.venue %}{{ w.venue.name | xml_escape }}, {% endif %}{{ w.year | xml_escape }}</summary>
</entry>
{%- endfor %}{% endfor %}
</feed>
